{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/725","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/725/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/725/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/derio-net/super-fr/issues/725/events","html_url":"https://github.com/derio-net/super-fr/issues/725","id":5601053615,"node_id":"I_kwDOR-_5V88AAAABTdlLrw","number":725,"title":"triage: theme comparison is case/whitespace-sensitive (mixed_themes, suggest)","user":{"login":"YiannisDermitzakis","id":10046982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis","html_url":"https://github.com/YiannisDermitzakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-27T08:15:03Z","updated_at":"2026-09-27T08:15:58Z","closed_at":"2026-09-27T08:15:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Filed at closeout of `2026-09-27-triage-batch-launch` (PR #723), journal finding **r2-2** (phase 2 review, reviewer: out of scope).\n\n## Problem\n\n`packages/fr/src/fr/triage/batch.py`'s `mixed_themes` compares `Judgement.theme` values with raw set equality, so `\"Docs\"`, `\"docs\"` and `\"docs \"` count as three different themes. `create`/`edit --skill debug` therefore prints the mixed-themes warning for a batch whose issues an operator would call one theme.\n\nThis convention is older than #723: `suggest()` groups themes by the same raw comparison, and themes are free text everywhere.\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nNormalise themes (for example, `strip().casefold()`) in one shared helper, and route both `mixed_themes` and `suggest()` through it, so the two can never disagree. Decide whether to normalise on write in `judgements.yaml` or only when comparing. Comparing only is the lighter change and leaves the file as the agent wrote it.\n","closed_by":{"login":"YiannisDermitzakis","id":10046982,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDQ2OTgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10046982?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis","html_url":"https://github.com/YiannisDermitzakis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YiannisDermitzakis/events